0141   A3                     AND   E   
0142   6F                     LD   L,A   
0143   F7                     RST   30h   
0144                             ; Signed compares. Both are "HL < DE" for the right pair: "<" swaps the two
0144                             ; cells first. Flipping both sign bits turns a signed compare into an
0144                             ; unsigned one (and XOR clears the carry for SBC); SBC HL,HL then turns the
0144                             ; carry into -1 or 0 with no branch.
