01E5                          ENDIF      
01E5                          IFN   CPM   
01E5                             ; Generic: Backspace takes the last character back (and is echoed as
01E5                             ; it is), CR ends (stored, not echoed), every other key is stored and
01E5                             ; echoed until the line is full. The line buffer starts at offset 80h
01E5                             ; of its page, so L alone is the place in the line: D holds the L of
01E5                             ; a full line.
01E5                          ENDIF      
