0208   18 E8                  JR   ln2   
020A   2D           LN4:      DEC   L   ; Backspace: one back, and echo it,
020B   FA 07 02               JP   M,ln3   ;   unless the line was empty (L left the
020E   2C                     INC   L   ;   upper half of the page)
020F   18 E1                  JR   ln2   
